cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DNA Entropy Graph in your work, please cite it as below, and please also cite Evo 2 (see references)."
title: "DNA Entropy Graph"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Yousuf"
    given-names: "Raaif"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Raaif-Yousuf/DNA-Entropy-Graph"
url: "https://github.com/Raaif-Yousuf/DNA-Entropy-Graph"
abstract: "A Windows app that computes a per-base Shannon entropy track for a DNA sequence with the Evo 2 genomic language model on a GPU in the user's own Google Cloud project, and exports it for IGV, Geneious, SnapGene and Benchling."
license: MIT
keywords:
  - entropy
  - Evo 2
  - genomics
  - genome browser
